msgstr "启用"

msgid "Error"
msgstr "错误"

msgid "Every task is one ffmpeg process. Changing a task requires a restart of that task to take effect."
msgstr "每个任务对应一个 ffmpeg 进程。修改任务后需要重启该任务才会生效。"

